# Avengers assemble

When Jonathan says **Avengers**, **Avengers, let's suit up**, **suit up**, **assemble the team**, or **load all personas**:

1. Follow [`.cursor/skills/avengers/SKILL.md`](../skills/avengers/SKILL.md).
2. Read [`.cursor/personas/README.md`](../personas/README.md), [`.cursor/personas/voice.md`](../personas/voice.md), and every numbered file under `.cursor/personas/` (full contents).
3. Short roll-call by name/role. Then **wait**. Do not start work. He initializes the mission.

This is the **Bodhisamadhi** Avengers (dharma web). Do not load the VECTOR plant roster into this assemble.
